COULOMB WAVE FUNCTIONS (p.540)
14.4.3  b_{2L+1}=1,\ b_{2L+2}=0,\quad 4\eta^2(k-2L)b_{k+1}+kb_{k-1}+b_{k-2}=0 \quad (k>2L+2)
14.4.4  \lambda_L(\eta)\sum_{k=2L+1}^{\infty} (-1)^k(k-1)!b_k=2\ \ \mathrm{(See\ chapter\ 9.)}
Expansion in Terms of Spherical Bessel Functions
14.4.5  F_L(\eta,\rho)=1\cdot3\cdot5\cdots(2L+1)\rho C_L(\eta)\sum_{k=L}^{\infty} b_k\sqrt{\tfrac{\pi}{2\rho}}J_{k+\frac12}(\rho)
14.4.6  b_L=1,\ b_{L+1}=\tfrac{2L+3}{L+1}\eta,\ b_k=\frac{(2k+1)}{k(k+1)-L(L+1)}\left\{2\eta b_{k-1}-\tfrac{(k-1)(k-2)-L(L+1)}{2k-3}b_{k-2}\right\} \quad (k>L+1)
14.4.7  F_L'(\eta,\rho)=1\cdot3\cdot5\cdots(2L+1)\rho C_L(\eta)\left\{\tfrac{(L+1)}{(2L+1)}b_L\sqrt{\tfrac{\pi}{2\rho}}J_{L-\frac12}(\rho)+\tfrac{(L+2)}{(2L+3)}b_{L+1}\sqrt{\tfrac{\pi}{2\rho}}J_{L+\frac12}(\rho)+\sum_{k=L+1}^{\infty} b_k'\sqrt{\tfrac{\pi}{2\rho}}J_{k+\frac12}(\rho)\right\}
14.4.8  b_k'=\tfrac{(k+2)}{(2k+3)}b_{k+1}-\tfrac{(k-1)}{(2k-1)}b_{k-1}
Expansion in Terms of Airy Functions
x=(2\eta-\rho)/(2\eta)^{1/3},\quad \mu=(2\eta)^{2/3},\ \eta>>0,\quad |\rho-2\eta|<2\eta
14.4.9  F_0(\eta,\rho)/G_0(\eta,\rho)=\pi^{1/2}(2\eta)^{1/6}\left\{\tfrac{\mathrm{Ai}(x)}{\mathrm{Bi}(x)}[1+\tfrac{g_1}{\mu}+\tfrac{g_2}{\mu^2}+\cdots]+\tfrac{\mathrm{Ai}'(x)}{\mathrm{Bi}'(x)}[\tfrac{f_1}{\mu}+\tfrac{f_2}{\mu^2}+\cdots]\right\}
14.4.10  F_0'(\eta,\rho)/G_0'(\eta,\rho)=-\pi^{1/2}(2\eta)^{-1/6}\left\{\tfrac{\mathrm{Ai}(x)}{\mathrm{Bi}(x)}[\tfrac{g_1'+xf_1}{\mu}+\tfrac{g_2'+xf_2}{\mu^2}+\cdots]+\tfrac{\mathrm{Ai}'(x)}{\mathrm{Bi}'(x)}[1+\tfrac{(g_1+f_1')}{\mu}+\tfrac{(g_2+f_2')}{\mu^2}+\cdots]\right\}
f_1=(1/5)x^2,\ f_2=\tfrac1{35}(2x^3+6),\ f_3=\tfrac1{63000}(84x^7+1480x^4+2320x),\ g_1=-(1/5)x,\ g_2=\tfrac1{350}(7x^5-30x^2),\ g_3=\tfrac1{63000}(1056x^6-1160x^3-2240) \ \ \mathrm{(See\ chapter\ 10.)}
14.5. Asymptotic Expansions
Asymptotic Expansion for Large Values of \rho
14.5.1  F_L=g\cos\theta_L+f\sin\theta_L
14.5.2  G_L=f\cos\theta_L-g\sin\theta_L
14.5.3  F_L'=g^*\cos\theta_L+f^*\sin\theta_L
14.5.4  G_L'=f^*\cos\theta_L-g^*\sin\theta_L,\ gf^*-fg^*=1
14.5.5  \theta_L=\rho-\eta\ln2\rho-L\tfrac{\pi}{2}+\sigma_L
14.5.6  \sigma_L=\arg\Gamma(L+1+i\eta)\ \ \mathrm{(See\ 6.1.27,\ 6.1.44.)}
14.5.7  \sigma_{L+1}=\sigma_L+\arctan\tfrac{\eta}{L+1}\ \ \mathrm{(See\ Tables\ 4.14,\ 6.7.)}
14.5.8  f\sim\sum_{k=0}^{\infty} f_k,\ g\sim\sum_{k=0}^{\infty} g_k,\ f^*\sim\sum_{k=0}^{\infty} f_k^*,\ g^*\sim\sum_{k=0}^{\infty} g_k^*\ \mathrm{where}\ f_0=1,\ g_0=0,\ f_0^*=0,\ g_0^*=1-\eta/\rho,\ f_{k+1}=a_kf_k-b_kg_k,\ g_{k+1}=a_kg_k+b_kf_k,\ f_{k+1}^*=a_kf_k^*-b_kg_k^*-f_{k+1}/\rho,\ g_{k+1}^*=a_kg_k^*+b_kf_k^*-g_{k+1}/\rho,\ a_k=\tfrac{(2k+1)\eta}{(2k+2)\rho},\ b_k=\tfrac{L(L+1)-k(k+1)+\eta^2}{(2k+2)\rho}
